{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Italian Brainrot TCG (Trading Card Game) is the ultimate card collector crossover you never asked for. Sit back, accumulate points over time, and spend them on chaotic booster packs overflowing with cursed Italian energy. Each pack reveals brainrot character cards \u2014 from espresso-enraged bishops to mozzarella-fueled gladiators. There's no clicking, no life bar, just a spiraling descent into Mediterranean madness one card at a time. Collect them all. Experience new brainrot meme cards and new never seen before characters with more to come in the future! Question everything. Welcome to Italian Brainrot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Open each card one at a time and experience the name as its narrated by the classic voice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736350/extras/Screen5.png?t=1748843056\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Work on collecting all the cards in the collection section to earn achievements and become a brainrot master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736350/extras/Screen2.png?t=1748843056\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Trade cards to complete the collection or purchase/sell them via the steam marketplace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736350/extras/Screen_6.png?t=1748843056\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3736350?t=1748843056","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3736350?t=1748843056","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736350/38dfa05a697ab646a235de32f08f7ebe0101e27b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748843056","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.st